> EXPLAIN (COSTS OFF) SELECT a FROM ga4_pi WHERE a = 26 AND b < 'B' FOR UPDATE
QUERY PLAN:text
LockRows
  ->  Index Scan using ga4_pi_part on ga4_pi
        Index Cond: (a = 26)
        Filter: (b < 'B'::text)
-- EXPLAIN

> EXPLAIN (COSTS OFF) SELECT * FROM ga4_pi WHERE a = 77
QUERY PLAN:text
Index Scan using ga4_pi_hash on ga4_pi
  Index Cond: (a = 77)
